# Netlify CLI writes the linked site ID here — local state, not shared config.
.netlify/

# Subagent-driven-development scratch: ledgers, task briefs, review packages.
# Working notes about a real client, and this repo is public.
.superpowers/

# Playwright MCP drops snapshots and console logs here when the page is
# screenshotted during a design pass. Local scratch, not shared config.
.playwright-mcp/

# Recall's local session transcript. This repo is public and these logs contain
# working notes about a real client — keep them on the machine.
.recall/

# Screenshots taken while checking a page in a browser. Playwright's own tool
# writes these to the repo root when given a bare filename, and `git add -A`
# will happily sweep them into a commit — as it did once. Local scratch only.
/*.png
